# Density Compare
# Niobium (Nb) — real density 8.57 g/cm³. equal masses: Niobium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Niobium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.8mm color: #73c2c9 at (-20mm, 4.9mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 68.4 g — the water cube is the reference
